WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.379 --> 00:00:02.273
- He's a spiritual
leader and founder of the

00:00:02.273 --> 00:00:04.078
Art of Living Foundation.

00:00:04.078 --> 00:00:07.268
He teaches that spirituality
enhances human values

00:00:07.268 --> 00:00:09.256
like love and enthusiasm.

00:00:09.256 --> 00:00:12.008
For his service, he has received
some of the highest awards

00:00:12.008 --> 00:00:13.086
from several countries.

00:00:13.086 --> 00:00:15.357
He's Sri Sri Ravi Shankar
and here is my take

00:00:15.357 --> 00:00:18.345
on his Top 10 Rules of Success Volume 2.

00:00:18.345 --> 00:00:20.828
Rule number one is my personal
favorite and I'd love to know

00:00:20.828 --> 00:00:22.330
which one you guys like the best.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.015
And as always, as you're
watching, if you hear

00:00:24.015 --> 00:00:25.861
something that really resonates with you,

00:00:25.861 --> 00:00:27.664
please leave it in the comments below.

00:00:27.664 --> 00:00:29.771
Put quotes around it so
other people can be inspired

00:00:29.771 --> 00:00:32.275
as well and when you write it
down, it's much more likely

00:00:32.275 --> 00:00:34.487
to stick with you as well.

00:00:34.487 --> 00:00:35.320
Enjoy.

00:00:39.079 --> 00:00:41.662
(upbeat music)

00:00:48.785 --> 00:00:52.875
- Life is not flowery,
not buttery, I tell you.

00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:54.458
So many challenges.

00:00:55.491 --> 00:00:57.741
Life has so many challenges

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:02.190
but the wisdom and knowledge equips you

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:04.107
to face the challenges.

00:01:05.872 --> 00:01:08.381
The difficulty is when you think life

00:01:08.381 --> 00:01:11.213
should not have challenges.

00:01:11.213 --> 00:01:15.380
Then challenges will appear
even much bigger to you.

00:01:16.768 --> 00:01:19.268
Life has challenges but wisdom

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:22.754
equips you to face them.

00:01:22.754 --> 00:01:24.950
Why do you want everything to be easy?

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:25.842
(audience laughs)

00:01:25.842 --> 00:01:27.509
Take some challenge.

00:01:29.223 --> 00:01:31.973
Challenges are necessary in life.

00:01:33.053 --> 00:01:34.636
Don't you think so?

00:01:37.135 --> 00:01:40.385
Everything is so easy, it is so boring.

00:01:41.451 --> 00:01:44.895
See how people go up on
this mountain and jump

00:01:44.895 --> 00:01:48.476
from the cliff with the hang glider.

00:01:48.476 --> 00:01:49.480
It's a challenge.

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:52.743
Some people want to go
and scale Mount Everest.

00:01:52.743 --> 00:01:57.439
Someone says, "Oh, I want
to sail through the world."

00:01:57.439 --> 00:01:58.884
These are all challenges, people.

00:01:58.884 --> 00:01:59.717
Take it.

00:01:59.717 --> 00:02:02.088
Take some little small challenges in life.

00:02:02.088 --> 00:02:04.505
How to deal with uncertainty.

00:02:06.116 --> 00:02:08.254
Turn back and see your own life.

00:02:08.254 --> 00:02:11.073
How many time you felt like that.

00:02:11.073 --> 00:02:14.123
How many times you spend worrying

00:02:14.123 --> 00:02:17.040
and things all happen right, right?

00:02:18.733 --> 00:02:21.141
In the right manner.

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:24.046
So, looking back at your own experience,

00:02:24.046 --> 00:02:28.971
you should say, "This is
futile to worry about it."

00:02:28.971 --> 00:02:29.904
Yeah?

00:02:29.904 --> 00:02:30.737
Second is,

00:02:34.207 --> 00:02:38.040
you should have confidence
in your own ability

00:02:41.827 --> 00:02:43.825
and in your own fortune.

00:02:43.825 --> 00:02:47.570
You should know that only the
best thing will happen to me.

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:49.252
It'll happen to me.

00:02:49.252 --> 00:02:50.585
That confidence.

00:02:52.718 --> 00:02:57.427
If these two things doesn't
work, there's a third option.

00:02:57.427 --> 00:02:59.192
Invoke the valor in you.

00:02:59.192 --> 00:03:00.954
Tell it, come what may.

00:03:00.954 --> 00:03:04.027
I will face it. I will handle it.

00:03:04.027 --> 00:03:06.030
I have the power to handle it.

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:08.363
You know, spirituality is...

00:03:11.568 --> 00:03:14.569
uplifting the spirit, your consciousness.

00:03:14.569 --> 00:03:17.309
Money is for your comfort.

00:03:17.309 --> 00:03:21.309
Money brings you comfort
in your material level.

00:03:23.004 --> 00:03:26.671
You know, we are spending
half of our health

00:03:28.745 --> 00:03:29.995
to gain wealth,

00:03:30.938 --> 00:03:35.105
and then we spend half of our
wealth to regain the health.

00:03:36.574 --> 00:03:38.574
It usually doesn't work.

00:03:40.088 --> 00:03:44.440
So, taking care of your
health, because health is the

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:46.523
best wealth one can have,

00:03:47.657 --> 00:03:49.657
is part of spirituality.

00:03:50.606 --> 00:03:52.606
With money, I would say,

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:58.097
money should be kept in your
pocket, not in your head.

00:03:59.094 --> 00:04:00.956
If you keep thinking
about money all the time

00:04:00.956 --> 00:04:05.038
you can't even enjoy the
money that you have produced.

00:04:05.038 --> 00:04:09.293
Money is needed but something
that is more necessary

00:04:09.293 --> 00:04:11.710
than money is that humanness,

00:04:13.339 --> 00:04:14.756
is that happiness

00:04:16.079 --> 00:04:18.174
that money cannot buy.

00:04:18.174 --> 00:04:20.398
Stop the mind, you know, it's racing.

00:04:20.398 --> 00:04:22.492
It's always thinking about the past

00:04:22.492 --> 00:04:24.583
or anxious about the future.

00:04:24.583 --> 00:04:28.686
We are angry about the past
or anxious about the future.

00:04:28.686 --> 00:04:31.746
To take a fresh look at the
world, to the situation,

00:04:31.746 --> 00:04:34.079
you need to wake up and see.

00:04:35.363 --> 00:04:37.342
As Mahatma Gandhi used to say,

00:04:37.342 --> 00:04:39.511
don't ever turn back and look.

00:04:39.511 --> 00:04:42.421
Say now let's look and
see what we should do now

00:04:42.421 --> 00:04:44.260
and for the future.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:48.480
That gives a lot of energy,
encouragement, enthusiasm

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:50.554
and lifts you up from the ashes,

00:04:50.554 --> 00:04:52.546
even though there are ashes.

00:04:52.546 --> 00:04:55.494
Action has some imperfection.

00:04:55.494 --> 00:04:58.850
Maybe 1% or 80% or 90%.

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:03.017
Some percentage of mistake
is always present in action.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:08.214
When you notice it, you
recognize a wise man accepts

00:05:08.214 --> 00:05:09.047
a mistake.

00:05:11.648 --> 00:05:12.481
But a fool

00:05:15.089 --> 00:05:17.608
doesn't see the mistake at all.

00:05:17.608 --> 00:05:20.987
A fool can miss blunders
but doesn't see the mistake.

00:05:20.987 --> 00:05:25.072
When someone points it
out, he doesn't accept it.

00:05:25.072 --> 00:05:27.594
He becomes defensive.

00:05:27.594 --> 00:05:30.019
This is what a fool does.

00:05:30.019 --> 00:05:30.852
You know?

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:36.120
Wise man, if he sees mistake in others,

00:05:37.091 --> 00:05:41.229
he helps them come out of it
in a compassionate manner,

00:05:41.229 --> 00:05:44.967
but the fool takes pride
in other's mistake.

00:05:44.967 --> 00:05:47.510
A fool is so happy if
someone else does a mistake

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:49.043
and he announces to the world,

00:05:49.043 --> 00:05:50.035
"Look! That person did a mistake.

00:05:50.035 --> 00:05:52.027
That person did a mistake."

00:05:52.027 --> 00:05:55.486
We have some very talented
people but they have certain

00:05:55.486 --> 00:05:56.819
mindless points.

00:05:58.162 --> 00:06:02.162
If you look at the mindless
points, the talents

00:06:03.685 --> 00:06:04.518
are gone.

00:06:07.562 --> 00:06:08.492
Isn't it?

00:06:08.492 --> 00:06:11.833
So, you don't see a very perfect person

00:06:11.833 --> 00:06:14.701
but your intention is to
see everyone as perfect.

00:06:14.701 --> 00:06:17.297
When you are looking for
perfection in everybody around,

00:06:17.297 --> 00:06:18.737
I tell you, you forget to see

00:06:18.737 --> 00:06:21.320
the imperfection inside of you.

00:06:29.244 --> 00:06:31.363
We want everything else to be perfect.

00:06:31.363 --> 00:06:33.613
Ah you mean the perfection.

00:06:35.281 --> 00:06:38.166
You have to look for that.

00:06:38.166 --> 00:06:40.122
When you see that you are perfect

00:06:40.122 --> 00:06:44.441
you will stop pointing out
and get frustrated about

00:06:44.441 --> 00:06:46.191
other's imperfection.

00:06:47.704 --> 00:06:50.623
If we are frustrated about
other's imperfection,

00:06:50.623 --> 00:06:52.540
we cannot contribute to

00:06:54.935 --> 00:06:56.510
their growth.

00:06:56.510 --> 00:06:58.343
They become imperfect.

00:07:00.478 --> 00:07:02.145
This is the dilemma.

00:07:04.852 --> 00:07:08.637
We want others to be perfect,
organizations to be perfect,

00:07:08.637 --> 00:07:12.304
nations to be perfect,
people to be perfect,

00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:17.934
and in this run, we
forget to see how we can

00:07:19.017 --> 00:07:21.346
improve ourselves.

00:07:21.346 --> 00:07:23.142
What do you say?

00:07:23.142 --> 00:07:23.975
Right?

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:28.647
So when we start looking within,

00:07:32.097 --> 00:07:35.622
a whole new dimension
opens in front of us.

00:07:35.622 --> 00:07:38.705
Choice is never between good and bad.

00:07:41.867 --> 00:07:46.128
There is no choice between water and sand.

00:07:46.128 --> 00:07:49.535
If a cup of sand is
kept and a cup of water,

00:07:49.535 --> 00:07:51.496
you do not say, "Which I want to drink?"

00:07:51.496 --> 00:07:54.232
(audience laughs)

00:07:54.232 --> 00:07:57.680
You will definitely drink water.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:01.040
If the choice is only
between water and juice,

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:01.933
you drink whatever.

00:08:01.933 --> 00:08:04.266
Both are necessary for life.

00:08:07.797 --> 00:08:10.388
So, when you think which
I will get more joy,

00:08:10.388 --> 00:08:14.589
your greed makes your
choice very difficult.

00:08:14.589 --> 00:08:18.679
When you're not so greedy, say nevermind.

00:08:18.679 --> 00:08:21.529
Now I will take water, little later juice.

00:08:21.529 --> 00:08:22.864
(audience laughs)

00:08:22.864 --> 00:08:24.947
You feel at ease with it.

00:08:26.543 --> 00:08:28.935
There is no choice between
good and bad at all.

00:08:28.935 --> 00:08:32.541
Once you know this is bad
you will never choose it

00:08:32.541 --> 00:08:34.041
because it is bad.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:38.933
So when you don't know it's good or bad,

00:08:40.203 --> 00:08:41.536
then use your...

00:08:43.068 --> 00:08:44.172
...sense,

00:08:44.172 --> 00:08:47.589
that which gives you long term happiness.

00:08:49.083 --> 00:08:51.875
Short term problems to be chosen.

00:08:51.875 --> 00:08:54.904
That which uses short term
happiness and long term

00:08:54.904 --> 00:08:57.321
problems should be discarded.

00:08:58.637 --> 00:08:59.654
Got it?

00:08:59.654 --> 00:09:01.808
So be in this world.

00:09:01.808 --> 00:09:03.004
Enjoy this world,

00:09:03.004 --> 00:09:04.921
yet, not get caught up,

00:09:07.135 --> 00:09:08.831
drown in it.

00:09:08.831 --> 00:09:11.248
Keep yourself a little alone.

00:09:13.627 --> 00:09:17.794
I'm saying keep yourself
untouched by the external.

00:09:19.112 --> 00:09:20.877
Save your soul.

00:09:20.877 --> 00:09:22.127
Save your mind.

00:09:23.042 --> 00:09:23.875
Save your spirit.

00:09:23.875 --> 00:09:25.042
Save your joy.

00:09:26.131 --> 00:09:28.214
Don't get that muddled by

00:09:30.402 --> 00:09:32.402
the events in the world.

00:09:34.437 --> 00:09:37.104
Are you getting what I'm saying?

00:09:38.071 --> 00:09:40.571
Don't let others or any events

00:09:43.031 --> 00:09:44.900
take away your freedom,

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:46.483
take away your joy,

00:09:48.198 --> 00:09:49.948
and your inner peace.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:53.302
This is how to feel.

00:09:53.302 --> 00:09:55.552
You found new ways to clap.

00:09:57.122 --> 00:09:57.955
Right?

00:09:59.375 --> 00:10:00.708
In the same way,

00:10:03.239 --> 00:10:05.989
in the world, in day to day life,

00:10:08.789 --> 00:10:12.152
so many events come to
put down your enthusiasm

00:10:12.152 --> 00:10:14.183
but never give up.

00:10:14.183 --> 00:10:18.183
When you light a candle,
and put it upside down,

00:10:20.737 --> 00:10:21.820
what happens?

00:10:22.954 --> 00:10:25.954
Does the flame goes down or goes up?

00:10:27.198 --> 00:10:29.531
Flame always goes up, right?

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:33.420
Like that, life is light.

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:35.420
Life is a burning flame.

00:10:37.804 --> 00:10:41.387
You should see that it
should always go up.

00:10:44.793 --> 00:10:48.210
Even there are 100 reasons to be unhappy,

00:10:50.354 --> 00:10:52.687
we should overcome them all.

00:10:54.754 --> 00:10:55.921
Who can do it?

00:10:57.353 --> 00:10:58.936
Only you can do it.

00:11:01.163 --> 00:11:01.996
Got it?

00:11:03.919 --> 00:11:07.669
So, at no point, don't
give up your happiness

00:11:08.663 --> 00:11:10.246
or your enthusiasm.

00:11:11.902 --> 00:11:14.485
Now, what is a way to be happy?

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:19.390
By sharing happiness, spreading.

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:22.560
When you spread happiness, it grows.

00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:25.919
When you don't spread
it, hold on to yourself,

00:11:25.919 --> 00:11:29.336
it dwindles, dwindles, and then finishes.

00:11:30.542 --> 00:11:32.092
This is what people don't know.

00:11:32.092 --> 00:11:33.925
They want to be happy.

00:11:34.981 --> 00:11:37.235
They don't know how to
share with everybody,

00:11:37.235 --> 00:11:39.485
how to expand one's family.

00:11:42.192 --> 00:11:44.079
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:11:44.079 --> 00:11:46.163
I'd love to know, what did
you take from this video?

00:11:46.163 --> 00:11:49.367
What was the most important
lesson that you learned,

00:11:49.367 --> 00:11:51.545
that blew your mind, that you're
going to immediately apply

00:11:51.545 --> 00:11:54.408
to your life or your business somehow.

00:11:54.408 --> 00:11:56.024
Please leave it down
in the comments below.

00:11:56.024 --> 00:11:57.362
I'm super curious to find out.

00:11:57.362 --> 00:11:59.311
Also, if you want to
nominate someone for the next

00:11:59.311 --> 00:12:02.197
Top 10 video, please check
the description for a link

00:12:02.197 --> 00:12:04.460
to a video where you can
votes for people and put in

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:05.960
your suggestions as well.

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.611
I also want to give a quick
shout out to Vihan Gopinath.

00:12:08.611 --> 00:12:10.499
Thank you so much for
picking up a copy of my book,

00:12:10.499 --> 00:12:11.759
"Your One Word".

00:12:11.759 --> 00:12:13.376
I really really really
appreciate the support

00:12:13.376 --> 00:12:14.951
and I hope you're enjoying the read.

00:12:14.951 --> 00:12:16.958
So thank you guys again for watching.

00:12:16.958 --> 00:12:17.935
I believe in you.

00:12:17.935 --> 00:12:19.975
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:12:19.975 --> 00:12:24.142
and whatever your one word is,
much love, I'll see you soon.

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:34.593
- There are four ways
to deal with a person

00:12:35.596 --> 00:12:39.013
who is doing things which you don't like.

00:12:41.853 --> 00:12:44.959
Are you ready to listen to it?

00:12:44.959 --> 00:12:46.876
First is, forgive them.

00:12:49.026 --> 00:12:49.859
Okay.

00:12:52.634 --> 00:12:54.375
Tell them don't do this again.

00:12:54.375 --> 00:12:55.757
Okay, now it doesn't matter.

00:12:55.757 --> 00:13:00.513
Anyway, it's happen, but
please don't do this again.

00:13:00.513 --> 00:13:02.096
Gentle forgiveness.

00:13:05.036 --> 00:13:07.453
Second time, when they do it,

00:13:11.109 --> 00:13:13.526
you should show indifference.

00:13:15.904 --> 00:13:17.737
You know indifference.

00:13:19.021 --> 00:13:22.271
You repeated it, I'm not
going to accept this.

00:13:22.271 --> 00:13:24.021
This is indifference.

00:13:24.988 --> 00:13:26.405
Don't talk to me.

00:13:28.866 --> 00:13:30.783
Third time they repeat,

00:13:35.836 --> 00:13:38.336
you simply cut off, move away.

00:13:39.738 --> 00:13:41.321
Take some distance.

00:13:43.193 --> 00:13:46.037
If they repeat on the fourth time,

00:13:46.037 --> 00:13:47.870
then you take a stick.

00:13:48.868 --> 00:13:53.006
If your really want
what you are aiming at,

00:13:53.006 --> 00:13:54.173
hold on to it.

00:13:56.579 --> 00:13:57.412
You know?

00:13:58.324 --> 00:14:01.769
But if you feel it is worthless
putting so much effort

00:14:01.769 --> 00:14:05.658
and what am I going to achieve by that,

00:14:05.658 --> 00:14:09.986
then you move on to something
which is much easier.

00:14:09.986 --> 00:14:10.819
Yeah?

00:14:11.933 --> 00:14:15.248
You know, once there was a
short term prime minister

00:14:15.248 --> 00:14:16.363
in India.

00:14:16.363 --> 00:14:19.670
He said, "Guruji, now I am
prime minister, I find for this

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:21.670
I struggled all my life.

00:14:23.021 --> 00:14:24.147
I find it's meaningless.

00:14:24.147 --> 00:14:25.980
Before I could sleep here happily.

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:28.896
See now there are 50 policeman guarding.

00:14:28.896 --> 00:14:33.063
I can't even sit outside
my own home in the farm."

00:14:34.573 --> 00:14:36.628
"Life is futile," he says.

00:14:36.628 --> 00:14:39.711
"It's a futile struggle all my life."

00:14:41.115 --> 00:14:45.724
I said, "Even to understand
this is took you so many years."

00:14:45.724 --> 00:14:48.290
Anyway, at least, now you
realize many people don't even

00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:51.749
realize at that time, what
is happening with all these

00:14:51.749 --> 00:14:53.499
dictators and rulers,

00:14:55.144 --> 00:14:56.477
in North Africa.

00:14:57.538 --> 00:15:00.839
They're all killing thousands of people

00:15:00.839 --> 00:15:02.839
just to hold onto power.

00:15:03.683 --> 00:15:05.183
This is stupidity.

00:15:07.544 --> 00:15:11.484
At least our gentleman
Indian prime minister had

00:15:11.484 --> 00:15:14.493
this sense, it was futile game.

00:15:14.493 --> 00:15:17.743
I said, "You are lucky, in this sense."

00:15:20.139 --> 00:15:23.370
So like that, if you want
to really achieve it so hard

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:25.790
then put all your life to achieve it

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:30.103
but you find something else
is better to put your energy,

00:15:30.103 --> 00:15:32.004
go in that direction.

00:15:32.004 --> 00:15:36.944
You know India has a long
history of spiritual upliftment.

00:15:36.944 --> 00:15:39.078
When you see that everything is collapsing

00:15:39.078 --> 00:15:41.867
and all doors are shut
and there is no hope

00:15:41.867 --> 00:15:46.667
and depression sets in and
I use a vision of, you know,

00:15:46.667 --> 00:15:48.995
something higher and the possibility

00:15:48.995 --> 00:15:52.725
and the power of your own
thought, the power of your mind

